cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "experts4bit-qlora: train and serve Mixture-of-Experts models that do not fit in VRAM"
abstract: >-
  Train and serve fused Mixture-of-Experts models in 4-bit on hardware
  that cannot hold them in bf16: fused 4-bit experts, QLoRA, CPU/NVMe
  offload, and inference on consumer NVIDIA GPUs.
authors:
